{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38860","headline":"舟行即事 · 杜荀鹤","name":"舟行即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年少髭须雪欲侵，别家三日几般心。\n朝随贾客忧风色，夜逐渔翁宿苇林。\n秋水鹭飞红蓼晚，暮山猿叫白云深。\n重阳酒熟茱萸紫，却向江头倚棹吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}